 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS・品種: 剪定不要だが花茎を切る花がら摘みで翌年の生育がよくなる。MBG・NC State（種）: 花後に花穂を取ると二番花・こぼれ種を抑える。晩夏の乱れは二年草として抜く話で C ではない。機械の A から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "No pruning required, but deadheading , cutting down the dead flowering stem, will encourage growth the following year",
  "management_type_by_matching": "A 放任型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/同じ種の別品種（Dg05・Dg08・Dg09・Dg10・図鑑の 'Monstrosa'）] 耐暑性；中（この品種のページはない。信頼度：低）\n[NC State/種] Foxglove does best with afternoon shade.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or North-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 2／NC State・種] Deadhead ... to avoid excessive numbers of seedlings / [MBG・種] freely self-seed（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 2／MBG・種] If flower spikes are left in place after flowering and allowed to go to seed, plants will act more as biennials and will, in optimum growing conditions, freely self-seed.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] Gaißmayer は 1 相当、stauden.de は 1 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・種] Wuchsverhalten: horstig, lockerhorstig, horstbildend\n[こぼれ種 2 の基準 2026-11-24] こぼれ種 2 で、雑草化・群落・野生化の記述があるので 強い：[読み直し] [MBG・種] often establishing large colonies",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[RHS・品種] Habit: Columnar upright",
